  <title translate="true">Min_Crossing_Angle</title>
  <body>
    <header>
      <para styleclass="Heading1"><text styleclass="Heading1" translate="true">Min_Crossing_Angle</text></para>
    </header>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><text styleclass="Strong" translate="true">Min_Crossing_Angle</text><text styleclass="Normal" translate="true"> calculates the angles between each cell face and a line connecting the cells on opposite sides of that face and returns the minimum angle it calculates. </text><text styleclass="Strong" translate="true">Min_Crossing_Angle</text><text styleclass="Normal" translate="true"> returns 0 for structured grids.</text></para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><text styleclass="Normal" translate="true">In an ideal DISV mesh, the angle would be 90 degrees for all cells.</text></para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><image src="IrregularCellAngle.png" imagestyleclass="Default" scale="100.00%" styleclass="Image Caption" figurelistinclude="0"><caption translate="true"><![CDATA[The red lines illustrate the minimum crossing angle for a cell.]]></caption></image></para>
  </body>
